# JVM hotspot crash dumps from local Gradle / Android Studio
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Local planning docs — keep local only.
# README.md and CHANGELOG.md are the tracked public documentation. ROADMAP.md
# remains the local source of truth for open work; RESEARCH.md stays local.
# The broad *.md rule below enforces this policy.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
RESEARCH.md
ROADMAP-COMPLETED.md
qa/
# The app's QA source set is checked-in test input, not local QA scratch.
!app/src/qa/
!app/src/qa/**

# Cross-project pollution — HostShield is a separate app whose research drafts
# sometimes end up in this working tree. Block them at the .gitignore layer and
# also lock with TrackedFilesAuditTest so they can never enter the tracked set.
HostShield-Research-Report.md
research/

# Markdown files local-only (except README and the published policy documents).
# docs/privacy-policy.md is the URL Google Play serves as the app's privacy
# policy, so it must be tracked and reachable on GitHub; docs/play-data-safety.md
# is the worksheet the Data safety form is filled in from.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!docs/models.md
!docs/privacy-policy.md
!docs/play-data-safety.md

# AI config
CODEX_CHANGELOG.md
AGENTS.md
.codex/
.ai/
PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
CONTINUATION_PROMPT.md
__pycache__/
*.bak
